always finish it.  However, this may put the counter above the level
at which you would normally choke.  If that counter is still too high
when you start your next meal, you immediately choke (and die unless
you have an "oLS or "oMB).  The moral of the story is to be VERY
careful eating when satiated, and especially careful after eating
dragon corpses...

